{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["And you shall destroy them quickly — all the battles you wage against them, you will defeat them swiftly, without the effort of a siege-rampart and mantlets over many days. Even so, you will not be able to make an end of them quickly — פן תרבה עליך חית השדה — for I will not allow you to fight against all of them in a single year. לא תוכל is the language of warning, as in: לא תוכל לתת עליך איש נכרי, לא תוכל לאכל בשעריך."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:38:32.434510828Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}